WEBVTT

00:06:29.329 --> 00:06:32.538
that helps render an uncontrollable
world more controllable.

00:06:33.204 --> 00:06:35.621
But also, there's something
about being in

00:06:35.621 --> 00:06:39.829
an extremely uncontrollable world that can
lead you to think again about where

00:06:39.829 --> 00:06:43.038
you do have some control areas where
you can make a difference.

00:06:43.663 --> 00:06:45.371
And so I wonder if that cuts both ways.

00:06:46.246 --> 00:06:53.454
Hmmm, that's interesting, I wanted to
ask you about the value of humility,

00:06:53.996 --> 00:07:02.829
because it seems like. Humility is
also at the center of what allows